 552               /TEST 2 = PRINT SPEED TIMING TEST
 553               /A SWIRL PATTERN IS PRINTED FOR ONE FULL MINUTE
 554               /WHILE THE NUMBER OF LINES PRINTED IS COUNTED.
 555               /TIMING WILL BE DONE BY DK8-EA OR DK8-EC CLOCK
 556               /OPTION IF EITHER IS AVAILABLE AND LOCATION
 557               /"CKFLAG" IS PRESET WITH THE TIME COUNT.
 558               /IF CKFLAG IS ZERO, MANUAL TIMING WILL BE USED TO
 559               /OBTAIN AN APPROXIMATE PRINT TIMING.
 560               /IF A HARDWARE SWITCH REGISTER IS NOT AVAILABLE, THIS TEST
 561               /CANNOT BE RUN WITHOUT A CLOCK OPTION BEING AVAILABLE.
 562               /THE PROGRAM WILL AUTOMATICALLY SKIP THIS TEST IF IT CANNOT BE RUN.
